<title>USA: Spectrum CEO Jack Johnston dies.</title>
<headline>Spectrum CEO Jack Johnston dies.</headline>
<dateline>ERIE, Pa 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Johnston, the president and chief executive officer of Spectrum Control Inc, has died, the company said Monday.  </p>
<p>It said Johnston died after heart surgery on December 27. The company, a manufacturer of electronic components, said it had formed an executive committee including the chief financial officer to supervise daily operations as its board of directors began searching for a successor.</p>
